{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world of Punch Champs, a tactical 2D fighter that challenges you to knock out your opponents and ascend the ranks to claim the title of the GOAT. This swift-paced platform fighter blends strategic combat with dynamic environments, ensuring no two battles are ever the same.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Demo Limitations \u2013 What\u2019s Available Now vs Full Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game is planned to include Online PvP, Cross-Platform Multiplayer, Achievements, Stats, Leaderboards and full controller support (Xbox and PlayStation).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae BEST PLAYED WITH A CONTROLLER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch Champs is best played with a controller, offering precise input and responsive gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/02e6e965fc639fb112a4ef852d5fdf3f.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/02e6e965fc639fb112a4ef852d5fdf3f.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/02e6e965fc639fb112a4ef852d5fdf3f.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udde0 SIMPLE, DEEP AND STRATEGIC</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls meet deep strategic gameplay. Whether you're stepping into the ring for the first time or you're a seasoned brawler. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/6d40ab4379fc081bb2d8343ff19429e0.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/6d40ab4379fc081bb2d8343ff19429e0.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/6d40ab4379fc081bb2d8343ff19429e0.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd4a CONTEXTUAL COMBAT SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the easy fight system, punches adapt in real-time based on your movement, creating fluid and responsive combat.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/9aa2e2ccc7a1d12ec09a99e6e1faa297.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/9aa2e2ccc7a1d12ec09a99e6e1faa297.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/9aa2e2ccc7a1d12ec09a99e6e1faa297.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u26a1 POWER-UP SHOWDOWN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate your battle tactics with an arsenal of power-ups! Each match is your arena to strategically unleash power-ups and turn the tide in your favour.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/af039854febf31f284954482e971cd39.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/af039854febf31f284954482e971cd39.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/af039854febf31f284954482e971cd39.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca5 ULTIMATE KNOCKOUT THRILLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the rush of every knockout! Each KO showcases your skill and power, delivering peak satisfaction as your opponent hits the ground. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/6140a3fc6c66296f02823a5386fd1c1f.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/6140a3fc6c66296f02823a5386fd1c1f.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/6140a3fc6c66296f02823a5386fd1c1f.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f DANCE OF DEFENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hone your timing with our intricate parry system, allowing you to absorb and counter with devastating effects.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/1538aff8341777f3e7f2d55843bca2ae.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/1538aff8341777f3e7f2d55843bca2ae.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/1538aff8341777f3e7f2d55843bca2ae.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2194\ufe0f PUSH-BACK PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the strategic push-back mechanic to control the battlefield. Use it to maintain distance or cunningly push adversaries into environmental hazards or off the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/efab4de57e7e7eb6c1566e63b807ac7e.poster.avif?t=1755225932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/efab4de57e7e7eb6c1566e63b807ac7e.webm?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/extras/efab4de57e7e7eb6c1566e63b807ac7e.mp4?t=1755225932\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2975930?t=1755225932","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755225932","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/c8c07ecb56934362baeb94f6703a61a551d011d6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755225932","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2975930/c8c07ecb56934362baeb94f6703a61a551d011d6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755225932","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3860900,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragrap